        "formTitle": "Gym Churn Radar: upload your gym data",
        "formDescription": "Export your members or check-ins as a CSV from your gym software and upload it here. Column names are matched automatically (member ID or email, name, plan, monthly fee, join date, status, trainer; or member ID/email plus check-in date and time).",
        "formFields": {
